#Fizzlestiks-prerest.lic
#Bard version of Brayis-prerest.lic (Fizzlestiks) -- no wands, so no fresh-wand
#sweep. Same chores his bigshot profiles used to list as resting_scripts (eherbs,
#eloot sell, ewaggle), plus the unlost check every prerest starts with, plus the
#town instrument: the two-handed drum, since nothing needs a free hand while
#he's safe (hunting uses the one-handed tambourine, see Fizzlestiks-prep.lic).

module FizzlestiksPrerest

# First, get off any unmapped room (go2 "current room not found"): see unlost.lic.
# Stops here -- bigshot is stopped too -- if it can't walk out.
Script.run("unlost")
exit if $unlost_failed

# Hunting is over: stop the hunting tambourine (playsongs.lic's before_dying
# stows it). Kill is async, so wait for it to actually finish before anything
# below sends its own fput commands, to avoid the two scripts racing on the
# same hands.
if Script.running?("playsongs")
  Script.kill("playsongs")
  wait_while { Script.running?("playsongs") }
end

# What the profile's resting_commands used to do on its own ("store weapon"
# routes the mace to its sheath per the in-game STORE config).
fput "store weapon"

Script.run("eherbs")
# Purify this trip's gems with Purification Song (1004) before the gem shop buys them
# (11/12). Gems go back where they were (eloot sells them); orb gems go to the linen
# pouch, which isn't a STOW target, so eloot never sells from it. fizzpure stops each
# gem at "improves somewhat", heals with eherbs itself if one explodes, and gives up
# (leaving the rest for sale) if mana or hit points don't come back within 10 minutes.
Script.run("fizzpure", "--raw=cloak,backpack,haversack --orbs=linen.pouch")
Script.start("eloot_guard") unless Script.running?("eloot_guard")  # unpauses eloot when its containers are full
Script.run("diskwait")  # eloot only finds the disk's boxes if the disk is here when the sell starts (10/28)
Script.run("eloot", "sell")
# Ghoul masters and tomb wights, the targets of his ghoul_master profile (11/12). Their
# bounties always read "...in the Graveyard near Wehnimer's Landing" (11/11-12 logs), and
# the guild also hands out moaning spirit / night hound culls there, which he doesn't hunt.
# Elder and ancient ghoul masters (on the profile's flee list) are turned down too.
Script.run("bounty_chooser", "kill ghoul master, tomb wight --kill-areas=Graveyard")
# Earlier plan, darkwood profile: darkwoodes, greater orcs and werebears in Upper Trollfang
# (greater orcs and werebears also get bounties in Cairnfang and the foothills of Zeltoph).
#Script.run("bounty_chooser", "kill darkwoode, greater orc, werebear --kill-areas=Upper Trollfang")
Script.run("ewaggle")

# Music whether or not you're AFK: he's a bard, so unlike the other characters'
# prerest scripts this ignores the afk_now UserVar (11/12).
#
# Music while safe/resting -- Fizzlestiks-prep.lic kills this again before combat
# resumes (which also stows the drum, see playsongs.lic's before_dying) and
# starts the tambourine for the hunt. The drum is two-handed; playsongs' own
# "requires two hands" retry handles the right hand if anything is in it.
Script.start("playsongs", "drum") unless Script.running?("playsongs")

end #End of module
